2
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:57,100
あたしタランちゃま！クモ人間なの！
I'm Taran-chama! I'm a spider-person!

3
00:01:57,200 --> 00:02:00,800
お前を食っちゃうぞ～！
I'm gonna eat you up!

4
00:02:00,900 --> 00:02:04,400
うふふ！だめだよ～！
Ufufu! You can't do that!

5
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:08,500
ずっとみんな、なかよし！
We'll be friends forever!

6
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:12,600
うふ、やくそくだよ？
Hehe, it's a promise, okay?

7
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:24,100
あなたは今どこで何をしていますか？
Where are you now, and what are you doing?

8
00:02:24,100 --> 00:02:30,000
この空の続く場所にいますか？
Are you somewhere beneath this same sky?

9
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:57,400
今まで私の心を埋めていたもの
The thing that had filled my heart until now...

10
00:02:57,400 --> 00:03:02,800
失って初めて気がついた
...I only realized its value after losing it.

11
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:08,200
こんなにも私を支えてくれていたこと
It had been supporting me so much...

12
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:13,600
こんなにも笑顔をくれていたこと
...and giving me so many smiles.

13
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:19,100
失ってしまった代償は
The price of losing it...

14
00:03:19,100 --> 00:03:24,700
とてつもなく大きすぎて
...is far too immense.

15
00:03:24,700 --> 00:03:30,100
取り戻そうと必死に
As I desperately try to win it back,

16
00:03:30,100 --> 00:03:35,500
手を伸ばしてもがくけれど
I stretch out my hand and struggle,

17
00:03:35,500 --> 00:03:40,900
まるで風のようにすり抜けて
but it slips through like the wind,

18
00:03:40,900 --> 00:03:46,700
届きそうで届かない
seeming so close, yet remaining out of reach.

19
00:03:46,700 --> 00:03:52,200
孤独と絶望に胸を締め付けられ
With my chest tightened by loneliness and despair,

20
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:57,700
心が壊れそうになるけれど
my heart feels like it's about to break, but...

21
00:03:57,700 --> 00:04:03,100
思い出に残るあなたの笑顔が
...your smile that remains in my memories...

22
00:04:03,100 --> 00:04:09,100
私をいつも励ましいてくれる
...always gives me encouragement.

23
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:36,000
もう一度あの頃に戻ろう
Let's return to those days once again.

24
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:41,600
今度はきっと大丈夫
This time, it will surely be alright.

25
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:47,100
いつもそばで笑っていよう
Let's always be smiling by each other's side,

26
00:04:47,100 --> 00:04:53,000
あなたのすぐそばで...
right beside you...

27
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:59,000
あなたは今どこで何をしていますか？
Where are you now, and what are you doing?

28
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,000
この空の...
Beneath this sky...

29
00:05:00,008 --> 00:05:03,408
...の続く場所にいますか
Are you in the place where it continues...?

30
00:05:04,308 --> 00:05:09,108
いつものように笑顔でいてくれますか
Are you smiling, just like always?

31
00:05:09,608 --> 00:05:15,008
今はまだそれを願い続ける
Even now, I keep wishing for that.

32
00:05:56,508 --> 00:06:01,308
生誕ライブ限定 グッズ販売のお知らせ！
Birthday Live Exclusive Merch Announcement!

33
00:06:01,508 --> 00:06:03,808
家族写真B2タペストリー
Family Photo B2 Tapestry!

34
00:06:04,008 --> 00:06:06,008
ゴージャスな額縁風デザインと...
With a gorgeous frame-like design...

35
00:06:06,008 --> 00:06:07,708
肖像画のような二人が...
...and the two of them looking like portraits...

36
00:06:07,708 --> 00:06:09,008
とってもキュート
...they are so cute!

37
00:06:09,108 --> 00:06:12,008
お部屋の壁に、今日の思い出を飾って...
Decorate your room's wall with today's memories...

38
00:06:12,008 --> 00:06:14,208
彩り豊かな推し活ができちゃいます！
...and enjoy a colorful life of supporting your favorite!

39
00:06:14,308 --> 00:06:16,008
おでかけちゃまぬいぐるみ
Outing-Chama Plushie!

40
00:06:16,008 --> 00:06:19,408
ボタン風の目がとっても可愛いぬいぐるみ！
A plushie with very cute button-like eyes!

41
00:06:19,508 --> 00:06:23,708
丁寧にひとつひとつ再現されたドレス衣装のちゃまと...
Chama in her dress outfit, meticulously reproduced piece by piece...

42
00:06:23,808 --> 00:06:26,308
一緒におでかけして旅に出れちゃいます！
You can go out and go on a journey together!

43
00:06:26,308 --> 00:06:28,508
鞄に付けれるハートチャーム付き！
Comes with a heart charm to attach to your bag!

44
00:06:28,508 --> 00:06:30,808
タランちゃまぬいぐるみポーチ
Taran-Chama Plushie Pouch!

45
00:06:30,808 --> 00:06:33,708
あの... タランちゃまが！ポーチに？！
That... Taran-Chama! Is a pouch?!

46
00:06:33,708 --> 00:06:37,708
背中のファスナーが開いて収納できる便利アイテム！
A convenient item with a zipper on the back that opens for storage!

47
00:06:37,708 --> 00:06:41,308
ゴスロリ衣装のタランちゃまが、可愛すぎる！
Taran-Chama in her gothic lolita outfit is just too cute!

48
00:06:41,408 --> 00:06:45,608
チェーンがついてるから、安心してお外にお散歩させられるよ！
With the attached chain, you can safely take her out for a walk!

49
00:06:45,808 --> 00:06:47,808
タランちゃまスマホリング
Taran-Chama Smartphone Ring!

50
00:06:47,808 --> 00:06:50,808
スマホの落下は、タランちゃまにお任せ！
Leave preventing smartphone drops to Taran-Chama!

51
00:06:50,808 --> 00:06:53,308
しっかり張り付いて守ってくれます！
She will stick tightly and protect it!

52
00:06:53,308 --> 00:06:57,008
愛くるしいお目目と、つい目が合っちゃう瞬間も...
Even those moments when you lock eyes with her adorable eyes...

53
00:06:57,008 --> 00:06:59,008
癒されてたまりません！
...are irresistibly soothing!

54
00:06:59,108 --> 00:07:01,308
全部セットは数量限定もあります！
The full set is also available in limited quantities!

55
00:07:01,308 --> 00:07:05,108
フルセット購入特典の数量限定バージョンは...
The limited edition version of the full set purchase bonus includes...

56
00:07:05,108 --> 00:07:08,408
箔押し複製メッセージ入りポストカードと...
...a postcard with a foil-stamped duplicated message...

57
00:07:08,408 --> 00:07:10,208
赤井はあと直筆サイン
...and Akai Haato's handwritten signature!

58
00:07:10,208 --> 00:07:13,208
特典ボイス『ひみつの話』もあるよ！
There's also a bonus voice track, 'Secret Talk'!

59
00:07:13,208 --> 00:07:14,808
プロモカードもあるよ！
A promo card is included too!

60
00:07:14,808 --> 00:07:18,508
hololive公式ECサイトへGO！
Go to the official hololive EC site!

61
00:07:51,008 --> 00:07:57,608
ひとつだけ、ただひとつだけ見つけたものは
The only thing, the one and only thing I found...

62
00:07:57,608 --> 00:08:07,008
誠実で不器用な、それでも柔らかな声
...was a sincere, clumsy, yet gentle voice.

63
00:08:07,008 --> 00:08:14,808
朽ちてゆき、ただ崩れゆく、世界を照らす
Illuminating a world that is decaying and simply crumbling away,

64
00:08:14,808 --> 00:08:22,008
暖かで、でも残酷な、去り際の笑顔
a warm, yet cruel, parting smile.

65
00:08:22,008 --> 00:08:28,808
ひび割れてく翡翠の水槽を満たすもの
Filling the cracking jade aquarium.

66
00:08:28,808 --> 00:08:38,508
「永遠ではない」なんて、初めから解ってたのに
Even though I knew from the start that 'nothing is forever'...

67
00:08:38,508 --> 00:08:46,508
壊れても、なお美しく、胸を刻むのは
What carves into my heart, remaining beautiful even when broken,

68
00:08:46,508 --> 00:08:53,608
砕けても、なお美しい、ひとりひとりの記憶
are the memories of each person, beautiful even when shattered.

69
00:08:53,608 --> 00:09:01,808
忘れたいのに、なお狂おしく、胸に残るのは
What remains in my heart, so agonizingly even though I want to forget,

70
00:09:01,808 --> 00:09:10,008
痛みさえ忘れさせた、微かな感触
is that faint sensation that made me forget even the pain.

71
00:09:19,208 --> 00:09:26,508
ひとつだけ、ただひとつだけ伝えたのは
The only thing, the one and only thing I conveyed,

72
00:09:26,508 --> 00:09:35,508
冷たさで誤魔化した、苦し紛れの嘘
was a desperate lie disguised with coldness.

73
00:09:35,508 --> 00:09:44,208
愛しくて、ただ愛しくて、選んだ言葉は
The words I chose, out of pure, deep love,

74
00:09:44,208 --> 00:09:50,008
すべて終わらせる偽りのセリフ
were a false line to bring everything to an end.

75
00:09:50,008 --> 00:09:58,008
風が吹けば飛ぶような砂に残した手紙
A letter left in the sand, likely to blow away with a gust of wind.

76
00:09:58,008 --> 00:10:00,008
「永遠ではない」という...
That 'nothing is forever'...

77
00:10:00,016 --> 00:10:05,816
「永遠ではない」ということさえ忘れられたのに…
Even though I'd forgotten that "nothing lasts forever"...

78
00:10:21,216 --> 00:10:28,516
もう一度、もう一度と、もう何度思ったでしょう
How many times have I thought, "Just once more, just once more"?

79
00:10:28,816 --> 00:10:35,516
枯れた花束、捨てられもせず
Holding a withered bouquet, unable to even throw it away,

80
00:10:35,816 --> 00:10:43,016
降り止まぬ雨は、まるで万雷の拍手喝采
The unending rain is like a thunderous round of applause,

81
00:10:43,316 --> 00:10:54,016
愚かな後悔を 嘲笑う怒涛のよう
Like a surging wave laughing at my foolish regrets.

82
00:10:55,016 --> 00:11:03,516
壊れても、なお美しく、胸を刻むのは
Even if it's broken, what still beautifully carves into my chest...

83
00:11:03,816 --> 00:11:10,516
砕けても、なお美しい、ひとひらの記憶
Even if it's shattered, is a single beautiful petal of memory.

84
00:11:10,716 --> 00:11:18,516
ああ忘れたいのに、なお狂おしく、胸に残るのは
Oh, though I want to forget, what maddeningly remains in my heart...

85
00:11:18,716 --> 00:11:25,816
痛みさえ忘れさせた、微かな感触
Is that faint touch that made me forget even the pain.

86
00:11:26,016 --> 00:11:31,516
痛みさえ忘れさせた、
It made me forget even the pain...

87
00:11:33,316 --> 00:11:41,216
微かな感触
A faint touch.

88
00:12:06,816 --> 00:12:11,216
「なんでいなくなっちゃうの…」
"Why are you leaving me...?"

89
00:12:11,516 --> 00:12:14,216
「こんなの苦しいよ…」
"This hurts so much..."

90
00:12:14,316 --> 00:12:18,216
「そばにいて…」
"Stay by my side..."

91
00:12:20,016 --> 00:12:23,816
「いつも、そばにいるよ。」
"I will always be by your side."

92
00:12:55,016 --> 00:12:59,216
もう忘れてしまったかな
I wonder if you've completely forgotten

93
00:12:59,216 --> 00:13:02,816
夏の木陰に座ったまま
how we sat in the shade of the summer trees,

94
00:13:02,816 --> 00:13:06,016
アイスを口に放り込んで風を待っていた
tossing ice cream into our mouths and waiting for the breeze.

95
00:13:06,016 --> 00:13:10,016
もう忘れてしまったかな
I wonder if you've completely forgotten

96
00:13:10,016 --> 00:13:13,516
世の中の全部嘘だらけ
how we said the whole world is full of lies,

97
00:13:13,516 --> 00:13:20,516
本当の価値を二人で探しに行こうと笑ったこと
and laughed about going to find its true value together?

98
00:13:20,816 --> 00:13:23,016
忘れないように
So that we won't forget,

99
00:13:23,116 --> 00:13:25,516
色褪せないように
so that it won't fade away,

100
00:13:25,516 --> 00:13:31,016
形に残るものが全⾮じゃないように
so that tangible things won't be everything.

101
00:13:32,816 --> 00:13:36,016
言葉をもっと教えて
Tell me more words,

102
00:13:36,016 --> 00:13:38,816
夏が来るって教えて
tell me that summer is coming.

103
00:13:38,816 --> 00:13:44,016
僕が描いてる目に映ったのは夏の亡霊だ
What was reflected in the eyes I drew was a ghost of summer.

104
00:13:44,116 --> 00:13:46,816
風にスカートが揺れて
With my skirt swaying in the wind,

105
00:13:46,816 --> 00:13:49,616
思い出なんて忘れて
forgetting all about memories,

106
00:13:49,616 --> 00:13:53,016
浅い呼吸をする
I take shallow breaths.

107
00:13:53,516 --> 00:13:59,016
汗を拭って夏めく
Wiping away the sweat, summer begins to bloom.

108
00:14:16,216 --> 00:14:20,016
もう忘れてしまったかな
I wonder if you've completely forgotten

109
00:14:20,016 --> 00:14:22,816
夏の木陰に座った頃
the time when we sat in the shade of the summer trees,

110
00:14:22,816 --> 00:14:27,216
遠くの丘から顔出した雲があったじゃないか
and how a cloud peeked out from the distant hill?

111
00:14:27,216 --> 00:14:30,016
君はそれを掴もうとして
You reached out to grab it,

112
00:14:30,016 --> 00:14:33,216
馬鹿みたいに空を切った手で
with your hand foolishly slicing through the empty air,

113
00:14:33,216 --> 00:14:35,816
僕は紙に雲一つを書いて
while I drew a single cloud on a piece of paper,

114
00:14:35,816 --> 00:14:38,216
笑って握って見せて
showing it to you with a smile in my hand.

115
00:14:39,016 --> 00:14:41,216
忘れないように
So that we won't forget,

116
00:14:41,216 --> 00:14:43,816
色褪せないように
so that it won't fade away,

117
00:14:43,816 --> 00:14:51,016
歴史に残るものが全てじゃないから
because what remains in history isn't everything.

118
00:14:51,516 --> 00:14:54,616
今だけ顔も失くして
For now, let's even lose our faces,

119
00:14:54,616 --> 00:14:57,016
言葉も全部忘れて
and completely forget our words.

120
00:14:57,016 --> 00:14:59,016
君は笑ってる
You are smiling,

121
00:14:59,016 --> 00:15:00,016
夏を待っている
waiting for summer.

122
00:15:00,024 --> 00:15:02,524
僕らは亡霊だ
We are ghosts...

123
00:15:02,524 --> 00:15:05,124
心をもっと教えて
Tell me more of your heart...

124
00:15:05,124 --> 00:15:07,724
夏の匂いを教えて
Tell me the summer scent...

125
00:15:07,724 --> 00:15:11,424
浅い呼吸をする
Taking shallow breaths.

126
00:15:40,524 --> 00:15:43,024
忘れないように
So I won't forget...

127
00:15:43,024 --> 00:15:45,324
色褪せないように
So it won't fade...

128
00:15:45,324 --> 00:15:51,524
心に響くものが全てじゃないから
Because what echoes in the heart isn't everything.

129
00:15:56,024 --> 00:15:58,524
言葉をもっと教えて
Tell me more words...

130
00:15:58,524 --> 00:16:00,824
さよならだって教えて
Tell me how to say goodbye, too.

131
00:16:00,824 --> 00:16:06,224
今も見るんだよ 夏に咲いてる花に亡霊を
Even now I see it, the ghost in the summer-blooming flower.

132
00:16:06,224 --> 00:16:08,524
言葉じゃなくて時間を
Not words, but time.

133
00:16:08,524 --> 00:16:11,224
時間じゃなくて心を
Not time, but your heart.

134
00:16:11,224 --> 00:16:15,524
浅い呼吸をする
Taking shallow breaths...

135
00:16:15,524 --> 00:16:21,024
汗を拭って夏めく
Wiping away sweat, becoming like summer.

136
00:16:23,024 --> 00:16:26,524
夏の匂いがする
It smells like summer.

137
00:16:33,224 --> 00:16:36,524
夏の匂いがする
It smells like summer.

138
00:16:41,524 --> 00:16:44,224
もう忘れてしまったかな
I wonder if you've already forgotten...

139
00:16:44,224 --> 00:16:47,024
夏の木陰に座ったまま
Sitting in the shade of a summer tree,

140
00:16:47,024 --> 00:16:54,024
氷菓を口に放り込んで風を待っていた
popping ice pops into our mouths, waiting for the breeze.

141
00:16:56,024 --> 00:17:00,024
というわけで、赤井はあと爆誕祭2025！
And with that, Akai Haato Birthday Festival 2025...

142
00:17:00,024 --> 00:17:03,024
始まっちゃうよー！
...is starting!

143
00:17:03,024 --> 00:17:04,524
イェーイ！
Yay!

144
00:17:04,524 --> 00:17:06,824
お、事故！事故！事故！あー
Oh, crash! Crash! Crash! Ah!

145
00:17:06,824 --> 00:17:09,524
あ、危ない、危ない
Ah, danger, danger!

146
00:17:09,524 --> 00:17:11,324
一曲目、一曲目だから！
It's only the first song, the first song!

147
00:17:11,324 --> 00:17:13,024
まだ、体力温存しないと
We still need to save our strength!

148
00:17:13,024 --> 00:17:14,324
ということで、ゲストに来てくれたのは
And so, the guest who came to join us is...

149
00:17:14,324 --> 00:17:15,524
らでんちゃん！
Raden-chan!

150
00:17:15,524 --> 00:17:20,024
こんばんは！ホロライブDEV_IS、ReGLOSSの儒烏風亭らでんでございます！
Good evening! I am Juufuutei Raden from hololive DEV_IS, ReGLOSS!

151
00:17:20,024 --> 00:17:22,024
ありがとう、来てくれて！
Thank you for coming!

152
00:17:22,024 --> 00:17:25,024
お誕生日おめでとうございます！
Happy birthday!

153
00:17:25,024 --> 00:17:26,524
ありがとう！
Thank you!

154
00:17:26,524 --> 00:17:28,024
そして、新衣装じゃないですか！
And, isn't that a new outfit!

155
00:17:28,024 --> 00:17:30,524
そうなんです！タララララン
That's right! Ta-da-da-da!

156
00:17:30,524 --> 00:17:32,024
綺麗！かわいい！
Beautiful! Cute!

157
00:17:32,024 --> 00:17:33,224
イェーイ！
Yay!

158
00:17:33,224 --> 00:17:35,524
この衣装めっちゃシナジーある！
These outfits have so much synergy!

159
00:17:35,524 --> 00:17:40,024
あ、あ、あ、あれ？
Ah, ah, ah, what?

160
00:17:40,024 --> 00:17:44,224
なんか、らでんちゃん言ってたけど、これ、クリスマスカラーだね、二人で
Actually, Raden-chan was saying earlier, this makes a Christmas color scheme for the two of us!

161
00:17:44,224 --> 00:17:45,324
そうなの！
Indeed!

162
00:17:45,324 --> 00:17:46,524
イェーイ！
Yay!

163
00:17:46,524 --> 00:17:48,024
らでんが今クリスマスツリー
I'm the Christmas tree now,

164
00:17:48,024 --> 00:17:51,024
で、はあちゃまはサンタ
and Haachama is Santa!

165
00:17:51,024 --> 00:17:53,024
サンタです
I'm Santa.

166
00:17:53,024 --> 00:17:55,024
サンタ、この季節にぴったり...ん？
Santa! Perfectly matches this season... wait?

167
00:17:55,024 --> 00:17:59,024
お、ぴったりですね、夏の匂いがします
Oh, perfect! It smells like summer!

168
00:17:59,024 --> 00:18:02,024
全然関係ない！
Absolutely unrelated!

169
00:18:02,024 --> 00:18:04,524
クリスマスだと思ってたのに！
And here I thought it was Christmas!

170
00:18:04,524 --> 00:18:07,524
そっか、あと、はあちゃま、あ、はあちゃまじゃない、赤井はあと
Right! Also, Haachama... wait, not Haachama, Akai Haato...

171
00:18:07,524 --> 00:18:11,024
爆誕祭2025でね
Birthday Festival 2025!

172
00:18:11,024 --> 00:18:15,524
是非ともSNSでスクショとか呟いてください！
Please post screenshots and tweets on SNS!

173
00:18:15,524 --> 00:18:20,024
来てください！お願いします！
Please do! We beg you!

174
00:18:20,024 --> 00:18:22,024
じゃあ、なんか写真撮るか！
Then, let's take some photos!

175
00:18:22,024 --> 00:18:24,024
写真撮りましょう！しとやかなポーズで行きますか？
Let's take photos! Should we go with a graceful pose?

176
00:18:24,024 --> 00:18:26,024
せっかくなので、シャキーン！
Since we're here... Sha-keen!

177
00:18:26,024 --> 00:18:29,024
どすこい！
Dosukoi!

178
00:18:29,024 --> 00:18:31,024
どすこい？
Dosukoi?

179
00:18:31,024 --> 00:18:34,024
キメポーズ！しとやかなポーズ！
Signature pose! A graceful pose!

180
00:18:34,024 --> 00:18:36,524
あ、これいいんじゃない？ホロライブ！
Ah, isn't this good? Hololive!

181
00:18:36,524 --> 00:18:44,024
強そう！強そう！強そう！
Looks strong! Looks strong! Looks strong!

182
00:18:44,024 --> 00:18:47,524
えー、じゃあ、どうしようかな、あ、ちょっとハートで！
Well, what should we do next... Oh, how about a heart?

183
00:18:47,524 --> 00:18:52,024
今時のハート！ハートで！
A trendy heart! With a heart!

184
00:18:52,024 --> 00:18:56,524
いいんじゃないですか！あ、可愛い！イェーイ！
Isn't this great? Oh, cute! Yay!

185
00:18:56,524 --> 00:18:59,524
そして、空間そして、そして、ハート！
And, and, and, heart!

186
00:18:59,524 --> 00:19:04,524
きゃー！あははは
Kyah! Ahahaha!

187
00:19:04,524 --> 00:19:11,024
戻ってきて、戻ってきて！
Come back, come back!

188
00:19:11,024 --> 00:19:14,024
もう、うちらの中じゃないですか！
We're basically soul sisters, aren't we?

189
00:19:14,024 --> 00:19:17,824
うわー、危ない、危ない
Whoa, dangerous, dangerous!

190
00:19:17,824 --> 00:19:22,524
今のね、着物のコツ入れただけだから
I was just adjusting my kimono's fit just now.

191
00:19:22,524 --> 00:19:24,024
コツ入れられたんですか？
Did you adjust it?

192
00:19:24,024 --> 00:19:27,524
まずい、まずい、戻りましょう、落っこちたりとかしないからね、別に
Uh oh, let's head back. It's not like we're going to fall or anything.

193
00:19:27,524 --> 00:19:31,024
しっとりした曲歌った後ですからね、そうだよ、しとやかね保存版
This is right after we sang a quiet song, after all! That's right, we must be graceful.

194
00:19:31,024 --> 00:19:34,024
しとやかにね
Gracefully.

195
00:19:34,024 --> 00:19:39,024
みんなスクショ撮ってくれてるかな？
I wonder if everyone is taking screenshots?

196
00:19:39,024 --> 00:19:41,024
撮ってくれてるかな？
Are they taking screenshots?

197
00:19:41,024 --> 00:19:45,024
というわけで、今回ですね、我々は
And so, this time, we are...

198
00:19:45,024 --> 00:19:49,024
なんか、ホロライブ...
Like, hololive...

199
00:19:49,024 --> 00:19:52,524
そうですよ、我々のユニット名、ホロライブですからね、覚えてくださいね
That's right, our unit name is 'hololive', so please remember it!

200
00:19:52,524 --> 00:19:55,524
いつの間にできてたの？だいぶ前？
When was that made? A long time ago?

201
00:19:55,524 --> 00:19:59,524
そうそう、ホロライブって感じで、らでんちゃんに来てもらいました！
Right, right! Under the 'hololive' banner, we had Raden-chan join us!

202
00:20:00,832 --> 00:20:03,432
そうですね、あの、衣装もシナジーがあるということで
Indeed. Our outfits have synergy too.

203
00:20:03,432 --> 00:20:07,432
え、花に亡霊をね、歌ったんですけども、どうでした？
So, we sang "Ghost in a Flower," how was it?

204
00:20:07,432 --> 00:20:09,132
え、もう…エモ。
It was just... emo.

205
00:20:09,132 --> 00:20:10,532
いや、エモ。
No, really, emo.

206
00:20:10,532 --> 00:20:13,232
いや、このステージとすっごい合ってたし。
Yeah, it really matched this stage perfectly.

207
00:20:13,232 --> 00:20:17,332
いや、やっぱね、あのラベンちゃんに歌ってほしいパートがあったんですよ、やっぱ。
And you know, there was a part I really wanted Raven-chan to sing.

208
00:20:17,332 --> 00:20:19,432
え？ / どこどこ？
Eh? / Where, where?

209
00:20:19,432 --> 00:20:23,032
「歴史に残るものだけがすべてじゃない」ってところで
At the part, "Not only things that remain in history are everything..."

210
00:20:23,032 --> 00:20:26,532
あ、これちょっとラベンちゃんに歌ってほしいなと思って
I thought, "Ah, I really want Raven-chan to sing this!"

211
00:20:26,532 --> 00:20:28,932
そのパートを分けさせてもらいました！
So I assigned that part to you!

212
00:20:28,932 --> 00:20:30,932
嬉しい！ / はーい！
I'm so happy! / Yay!

213
00:20:30,932 --> 00:20:34,232
でも、どっかで歌いたいなって思ってた曲だったから
But it was a song I've been wanting to sing somewhere,

214
00:20:34,232 --> 00:20:36,532
あ、そうなんだ！よかった〜！ / この曲一緒に歌いたいんだって言ってくれた時
Oh, really? I'm so glad! / ...so when you said you wanted to sing it together,

215
00:20:36,532 --> 00:20:38,932
「え、めっちゃ嬉しい！」と思って。 / よかった、嬉しい！
I was like, "Wow, I'm so happy!" / I'm glad, so happy!

216
00:20:38,932 --> 00:20:41,232
ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

217
00:20:41,232 --> 00:20:45,032
じゃあ、じゃあ頑張って帰ってね。
Well then, do your best to go back.

218
00:20:45,032 --> 00:20:48,032
こ、ここから？！ここ…ここから？！ええ？！
Fr-from here?! From... from here?! What?!

219
00:20:48,032 --> 00:20:50,432
あははは！うん。もう、じゃ、じゃあね、ほな！
Hahaha! Yeah. Well, see ya, bye!

220
00:20:50,432 --> 00:20:52,532
ほな！
Bye!

221
00:20:52,532 --> 00:20:54,632
これからも頑張ってください！
Please keep doing your best!

222
00:20:54,632 --> 00:20:56,532
ありがとう！
Thank you!

223
00:20:56,532 --> 00:20:59,032
これからも頑張ってください…これどうやって帰るの？
Please keep doing your best... How do I go back?

224
00:20:59,032 --> 00:21:01,032
これどうやって帰るの？
How do I go back?

225
00:21:01,032 --> 00:21:02,532
あ、あっち、あっち、こっち、あっち。
Ah, over there, over there, here, there.

226
00:21:02,532 --> 00:21:05,532
そう、あっちとかこっちとかあるんだ、こういうのって。あ、木、危ない。
Right, there's "over there" and "over here" for these things. Ah, the tree, watch out!

227
00:21:05,532 --> 00:21:09,132
ありがとう！頑張ってください！バイバーイ！
Thank you! Good luck! Bye-bye!

228
00:21:21,532 --> 00:21:28,032
あーあー
Ah...

229
00:21:28,032 --> 00:21:34,532
らららら…
La la la...

230
00:21:38,232 --> 00:21:43,832
遥か遠い遠い昔に巻かれた首輪
A collar wound tight around my neck a long, long time ago

231
00:21:44,232 --> 00:21:47,032
人が欲しい 人が欲しいと
I want people, I want people...

232
00:21:47,032 --> 00:21:50,032
叫ぶ呪いの首輪
...screams the cursed collar.

233
00:21:50,532 --> 00:21:53,332
怒らないで 見捨てないで
Don't be angry, don't abandon me...

234
00:21:53,332 --> 00:21:56,532
どこも行かないで
...don't go anywhere.

235
00:21:56,532 --> 00:21:59,532
強く締める 吐くまで締める
Squeezing tightly, squeezing till I vomit...

236
00:21:59,532 --> 00:22:02,532
人がいない いないと
...crying out that there's nobody, nobody.

237
00:22:03,032 --> 00:22:06,032
いい成績でしょう ねえ ねえ
I have great grades, right? Hey, hey.

238
00:22:06,032 --> 00:22:09,032
いい子でしょう
I'm a good child, right?

239
00:22:09,032 --> 00:22:12,532
かわいい子でしょう ねえ
I'm a cute child, right? Hey,

240
00:22:12,532 --> 00:22:15,532
良い子でしょう
I'm a good child, right?

241
00:22:15,532 --> 00:22:18,532
苦しい ねえ
It hurts, hey.

242
00:22:18,532 --> 00:22:21,532
愛して 愛して 愛して
Love me, love me, love me,

243
00:22:21,532 --> 00:22:25,032
もっと もっと
more and more.

244
00:22:25,032 --> 00:22:28,032
愛して 愛して
Love me, love me,

245
00:22:28,032 --> 00:22:30,532
狂おしいほどに
to the point of madness.

246
00:22:30,532 --> 00:22:33,532
苦しい 苦しい
It hurts, it hurts,

247
00:22:33,532 --> 00:22:35,532
呪縛を 解いて 解いて ねえ
break this curse, break it, hey.

248
00:22:35,532 --> 00:22:40,032
止められない
It cannot be stopped...

249
00:22:40,032 --> 00:22:44,032
ああ
...ah.

250
00:23:02,032 --> 00:23:08,032
あーあー
Ah...

251
00:23:15,032 --> 00:23:18,032
体 体 大きくなっても
Even as my body, my body grows...

252
00:23:18,032 --> 00:23:20,832
小さい首輪
...the collar remains small.

253
00:23:21,032 --> 00:23:24,032
苦しくなる 足りなくなる
It becomes painful, it becomes insufficient...

254
00:23:24,032 --> 00:23:27,232
人が 人が 足りない
...there are not enough, not enough people.

255
00:23:27,532 --> 00:23:30,532
クラスの誰にも負けない
I'm better than anyone in my class,

256
00:23:30,532 --> 00:23:33,232
綺麗ないい子でしょう
a beautiful, good child, right?

257
00:23:33,232 --> 00:23:36,532
誰よりも 誰よりも
More than anyone, more than anyone,

258
00:23:36,532 --> 00:23:39,832
誰も彼も 私を見てよ
everyone, look at me.

259
00:23:40,032 --> 00:23:43,032
体育館裏
Behind the gymnasium...

260
00:23:43,032 --> 00:23:46,032
あなたに 告白を
...I confess my love to you.

261
00:23:46,032 --> 00:23:49,032
嘘みたいでしょう
It seems like a lie, doesn't it?

262
00:23:49,032 --> 00:23:52,532
あなたが好きなの
I like you,

263
00:23:52,532 --> 00:23:55,532
汚いあなたを
even your dirty self.

264
00:23:55,532 --> 00:23:59,032
愛して 愛して 愛して
Love me, love me, love me,

265
00:23:59,032 --> 00:24:02,032
全部あげる
I'll give you everything.

266
00:24:02,032 --> 00:24:05,032
あなたに あなたに
To you, to you,

267
00:24:05,032 --> 00:24:08,032
全部背負ってもらうよ
I'll make you bear everything.

268
00:24:08,032 --> 00:24:11,032
足りない あなたが
It's not enough, you...

269
00:24:11,032 --> 00:24:14,032
足りない 離さないよ
...are not enough. I won't let go.

270
00:24:14,032 --> 00:24:17,532
ああ
Ah...

271
00:24:17,532 --> 00:24:20,532
ごめんなさい
I'm sorry.

272
00:24:20,532 --> 00:24:23,532
愛して 愛して 愛して
Love me, love me, love me,

273
00:24:23,532 --> 00:24:27,032
もっと もっと
more and more.

274
00:24:27,032 --> 00:24:29,832
愛して 愛して
Love me, love me,

275
00:24:29,832 --> 00:24:32,832
狂おしいほどに
to the point of madness.

276
00:24:32,832 --> 00:24:35,832
苦しい 離さない
It hurts, I won't let go,

277
00:24:35,832 --> 00:24:39,032
苦しい もっともっと ねえ
it hurts, more and more, hey.

278
00:24:39,032 --> 00:24:42,532
幸せなの
I'm happy...

279
00:24:42,532 --> 00:24:47,032
ああ
...ah.

280
00:24:47,032 --> 00:24:58,032
おおー！
Oh...!

281
00:25:07,840 --> 00:25:11,040
幸せなの？
Are you happy?

282
00:25:32,040 --> 00:25:33,240
Yay!

283
00:25:33,240 --> 00:25:34,540
Yeah!

284
00:25:34,540 --> 00:25:37,040
We got chainsaws!

285
00:25:37,040 --> 00:25:39,540
I got one! Me too!

286
00:25:39,540 --> 00:25:41,540
I want one too!

287
00:25:41,540 --> 00:25:44,540
Haachama's chainsaw too!

288
00:25:44,540 --> 00:25:47,040
I want to chase that too!

289
00:25:47,040 --> 00:25:49,040
Oh wow, that's heavy.

290
00:25:49,040 --> 00:25:51,040
Okay, let's fight.

291
00:25:51,040 --> 00:25:52,540
Let's go!

292
00:25:52,540 --> 00:25:55,040
Yeah!

293
00:25:55,040 --> 00:25:59,040
I feel so 努力、未来、A BEAUTIFUL STAR!
I feel so effort, future, a beautiful star!

294
00:25:59,040 --> 00:26:03,040
Yeah, innocent! I wanna ride the chainsaw!

295
00:26:03,040 --> 00:26:07,040
努力、未来、A BEAUTIFUL STAR!
Effort, future, a beautiful star!

296
00:26:07,540 --> 00:26:09,040
愛して
Love me

297
00:26:09,040 --> 00:26:13,040
愛して、愛して、愛して was so nice!
"Love me, love me, love me" was so nice!

298
00:26:13,040 --> 00:26:17,040
Yeah, we sang together.

299
00:26:17,040 --> 00:26:21,040
Happy birthday, Haachama!

300
00:26:21,040 --> 00:26:24,540
Yay, it's a really nice birthday today!

301
00:26:24,540 --> 00:26:27,540
Thank you for letting us celebrate with you.

302
00:26:27,540 --> 00:26:29,540
Thanks for playing!

303
00:26:29,540 --> 00:26:31,540
That was so fun!

304
00:26:33,540 --> 00:26:38,040
Oh, it's the first time we also with the... blue?

305
00:26:38,040 --> 00:26:40,040
Yeah!

306
00:26:40,040 --> 00:26:44,040
And... Haachama... we are...

307
00:26:44,040 --> 00:26:49,040
Hachatorisa! We made it!

308
00:26:49,040 --> 00:26:53,040
We just jumbled our names together.

309
00:26:53,040 --> 00:26:55,040
Let's take a picture!

310
00:26:55,040 --> 00:26:57,040
Okay, everyone take a picture.

311
00:27:15,040 --> 00:27:16,540
Nice!

312
00:27:16,540 --> 00:27:18,540
Yeah! Take a screenshot!

313
00:27:18,540 --> 00:27:21,540
It's so cool!

314
00:27:24,040 --> 00:27:28,040
Dangerous! Dangerous!

315
00:27:29,540 --> 00:27:32,540
Let's kill them!

316
00:27:32,540 --> 00:27:33,540
On camera?

317
00:27:33,540 --> 00:27:35,040
Yeah, camera!

318
00:27:35,040 --> 00:27:36,540
Say goodbye!

319
00:27:36,540 --> 00:27:39,040
Goodbye!

320
00:27:54,040 --> 00:27:56,540
ねえ 私 知ってるよ 君が ひとり
Hey, I know you're all alone.

321
00:27:56,540 --> 00:27:58,540
知ってるの 知ってるよ
I know, I know.

322
00:27:58,540 --> 00:28:00,040
ピコピコ 震えてさ
Beeping and shaking.

323
00:28:00,040 --> 00:28:02,040
子供だもの 無理なんじゃない？
You're just a kid, so isn't it impossible?

324
00:28:02,040 --> 00:28:03,540
正直に言っちゃいよ
Just say it honestly.

325
00:28:03,540 --> 00:28:05,540
バレてるんだし 言っちゃいよ
It's already exposed, so just say it.

326
00:28:05,540 --> 00:28:06,540
聞いてんの？
Are you listening?

327
00:28:06,540 --> 00:28:08,540
フツフツ 恥ずかしい
Seething and embarrassed.

328
00:28:08,540 --> 00:28:10,540
みんな隠しているだけ
They're all just hiding it.

329
00:28:10,040 --> 00:28:15,040
モニタリング
[Title: Monitoring]

330
00:28:16,040 --> 00:28:18,540
ねえ 私 知ってるよ 君が ひとり 涙し
Hey, I know you shed tears alone.

331
00:28:18,540 --> 00:28:21,040
知ってるの 知ってるよ
I know, I know.

332
00:28:21,040 --> 00:28:23,040
ズクンズクン 凹んでさ
Throbbing and feeling down.

333
00:28:23,040 --> 00:28:24,540
弱い人から いいんじゃない？
Why not start with the weak?

334
00:28:24,540 --> 00:28:27,540
朝が来るまで 一生仮想 もっと泣いたって
Until morning comes, let's imagine forever, even if you cry more...

335
00:28:27,540 --> 00:28:30,040
何度だって 受け止めてあげる
No matter how many times, I will accept you.

336
00:28:30,040 --> 00:28:31,540
もう不安はナシにして
Put your anxieties aside,

337
00:28:31,540 --> 00:28:33,040
いっぱい出していってね
and let it all out.

338
00:28:33,040 --> 00:28:35,540
ほら おねがい 君が欲しいの
Look, please, I want you.

339
00:28:35,540 --> 00:28:37,540
慰めさせて シェイクシェイク
Let me comfort you, shake shake.

340
00:28:37,540 --> 00:28:39,540
愛のサインで 泣いてくれるかな
Will you cry for me at the sign of love?

341
00:28:39,540 --> 00:28:41,540
濡れていてよ 体痛い？
Stay wet, does your body hurt?

342
00:28:41,540 --> 00:28:43,040
ねえ いいでしょ
Hey, it's fine, right?

343
00:28:43,040 --> 00:28:45,040
喉元通って飲み干したい
I want to drink it down through my throat.

344
00:28:45,040 --> 00:28:46,040
だ、だ、だ、だ、だ
Da, da, da, da, da!

345
00:28:46,040 --> 00:28:48,540
ほら おねがい 君が欲しいの
Look, please, I want you.

346
00:28:48,540 --> 00:28:50,540
手料理散らして シックラブ
Scattering home-cooked meals, sick love.

347
00:28:50,540 --> 00:28:52,540
なんて最高ね 分けてくれるかな
How wonderful, will you share it with me?

348
00:28:52,540 --> 00:28:54,540
君の痛い？ 見せてよ
Does it hurt? Show me.

349
00:28:54,540 --> 00:28:56,040
ねえ いいでしょ
Hey, it's fine, right?

350
00:28:56,040 --> 00:28:58,040
吸い取って 吸い取りたい
I want to suck it up, absorb it.

351
