00:31:17,448 --> 00:31:20,148
そこどきな邪魔だ 俺はもう1人のあなた
Out of my way, you're in the way! I am another you.

401
00:31:20,148 --> 00:31:23,248
貞ちゃん伽椰ちゃんワンサカ黄泉の国wonderland
Sada-chan, Kaya-chan, a crowd in the underworld wonderland!

402
